---
import VisualFigure from "./VisualFigure.astro";
---

<VisualFigure
  id="airis-load-testing"
  label="AIRIS · Engineering handoff"
  title="From diagnosis to recommendation"
  tone="airis"
  altText="A compact three-stage AIRIS path shows controlled workload testing, bottleneck diagnosis, and an engineering handoff with recommendations accepted by the senior engineer and stakeholder training as outcomes. Several recommendations were later incorporated into the senior engineer's implementation; no production improvement is claimed."
  caption="AIRIS handoff: tested workload behavior, diagnosed bottlenecks, and presented recommendations accepted by the senior engineer. No production improvement is claimed."
>
  <div slot="graphic" class="visual-art visual-art--airis" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="v4d-airis-path">
      <article class="v4d-airis-stage">
        <span class="v4d-airis-stage__number">01</span>
        <p class="v4d-label">Test workload</p>
        <strong>Controlled testing</strong>
      </article>

      <span class="v4d-airis-path__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>

      <article class="v4d-airis-stage v4d-airis-stage--focus">
        <span class="v4d-airis-stage__number">02</span>
        <p class="v4d-label">Diagnose bottlenecks</p>
        <strong>Optimization research</strong>
      </article>

      <span class="v4d-airis-path__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>

      <article class="v4d-airis-stage v4d-airis-stage--handoff">
        <span class="v4d-airis-stage__number">03</span>
        <p class="v4d-label">Handoff recommendations</p>
        <div class="v4d-airis-outcomes">
          <span>Recommendations accepted</span>
          <span>Stakeholder training</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="v4d-boundary-note">Several recommendations were later incorporated into the senior engineer's implementation; no production improvement is claimed.</p>
  </div>
  <ol slot="fallback" class="visual-figure__fallback-list">
    <li>Hydar performed controlled workload testing.</li>
    <li>Observed behavior informed bottleneck diagnosis and optimization research.</li>
    <li>The findings became recommendations accepted by the senior engineer and supported stakeholder training; several were later incorporated into the senior engineer's implementation, with no production improvement claimed.</li>
  </ol>
</VisualFigure>
